# Dependencies
node_modules/

# NOTE: `lib/` is intentionally NOT ignored.
# `dsh plugin add <git-url>` installs the repository as-is; without the built
# artifacts the Loader row would fail to resolve. Keep `npm run build` output
# committed so a git install works without a build step.
